    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "The Go1 API lets partners and platforms discover Go1's learning content library, manage learner enrollments, provision and manage customer portals, and subscribe to Go1 events via webhooks. Versioning is date-based and selected per request with the `Api-Version` header (current: 2025-01-01). All requests are authenticated with OAuth 2.0 bearer tokens issued by https://auth.go1.com/oauth/token. Reconstructed by the API Evangelist enrichment pipeline from Go1's published REST reference (developers.go1.com) — operations, parameters, responses and scopes are Go1's verbatim reference data.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Go1 Developer Support",
      "type": "text/plain"
    }
